Subject: [PATCH 2/7] test(rag): cover eval metrics and MLflow tracking

Unit tests for score_case (Hit/Recall/Precision/nDCG/MRR), dedupe, dataset
validation, metric flattening and an end-to-end MLflow run on a temp
SQLite store (skipped when mlflow is not installed).
